{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0132q7usE8kRSMJA11TVyhQA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 数据重复问题 (2026-05-14)\\\\n源数据 5K 轨迹中有 2,552 条共享 `instance_id + model_name`（同一 issue 多次 agent run）。\\\\n修复：trajectory_id 改为 `instance_id__model_name__r{row_index}`（data_loader.py + window_extractor.py）。\\\\n修复后：59,496 唯一窗口 / 5,000 唯一轨迹 / 0 重复。\\\\n\\\\n## LF1 冲突分析脚本 bug (2026-05-14)\\\\n`lf_conflict_analysis.md` 中报告的 \\\\\\\"LF1=PROGRESS + edit_count=0\\\\\\\" 是分析脚本特征提取与 LF 代码不一致导致的显示错误，不影响实际标签质量。已确认 `windows_labeled.jsonl` 标签正确。\\\\n\\\\n## AutoDL 5090 连接 (2026-05-14)\\\\n密码: H6BKr9xWo+8Z, 端口 23165。SSH config 需用 `PreferredAuthentications password,keyboard-interactive`，不能用 IdentityFile。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 环境 (2026-05-14)\\\\nautodl-5090 已验证：torch 2.10+cu128, Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 测试通过（~2.23GB VRAM）。\\\\nconda 环境：`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`\\\\n\\\\n## 模型版本 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B: dim=1024, 已验证可用\\\\n\\\\n## Cron 监控注意事项 (2026-05-14)\\\\n嵌入生成类任务（generate_embeddings.py）正常退出后无 W&B/sentinel，cron 无法区分成功/失败，会误判为 \\\\\\\"process dead N× — auto-resolved as failed\\\\\\\"。此类批处理任务需手动验证输出文件完整性（文件大小 + window 数 + 字段完整性）。建议后续给 generate_embeddings.py 添加 sentinel 文件写入。\\\\n\\\\n## emb_001 数据分布 (2026-05-14)\\\\n54,809 usable windows（排除 4,687 ABSTAIN）：\\\\n- 标签: progress=39,209 (71.5%) / stagnation=15,600 (28.5%)\\\\n- 置信度: conf=1: 39,408 / conf=2: 14,609 / conf=3: 792\\\\n- conf≥2 子集: 15,401 windows（用于 probe_001 主实验）\\\\n- 类别不平衡约 2.5:1，train_probe.py 用 pos_weight 自动补偿\\\\n\\\\n## probe_001 MVP 成功经验 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- GRU(2-layer, hidden=256) 在 conf≥2 数据上 test macro-F1=0.9055，val macro-F1=0.9511\\\\n- epoch 3 即达最优，模型容量充足，训练稳定\\\\n- Repeat-3 是唯一有意义的 baseline (0.8432)，Random/Majority/CosineSim 均 < 0.50\\\\n- GRU 在 stagnation 检测上优势最大（F1 0.8593 vs Repeat-3 0.7532，+10.6pp）\\\\n- 关键参数：lr=1e-3, batch=32, AdamW, BCEWithLogitsLoss + pos_weight, early stopping patience=5\\\\n- W&B 未配置会导致 wandb.init() 崩溃，MVP 阶段用 train_history.json 即可\\\\n\\\\n## Dream 审稿结论 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- Best tier reviewer 确认原始 framing 完全成立，三条 claims 无需调整强度\\\\n- Median tier reviewer 因 rate limit 未完成（仅 3 行日志），不影响结论\\\\n- Dream 给出了各 baseline 的预期值范围，可作为实验结果的 sanity check 参照\\\\n- 建议不重跑 median reviewer——best tier 已覆盖所有关键实验预期\\\\n\\\\n## LF Oracle Baseline 代码已就绪 (2026-05-14)\\\\nWorker code:lf_oracle_baseline 已完成，产出 art_20260514_88f4dc。评估 6 种 LF 投票策略（majority, any-stagnation, all-agreement, 3 single-LF），复用 probe_001 的 test split，无需训练。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2180, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MbVMY3G7diYAUeDjF1aRAe","session_id":"3eaa2ba6-aa45-4be4-a541-eab7cb4981f6","uuid":"31baa36a-9bf8-44a1-8882-4de0d0f63541","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:59:34.856Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WtYzL7iTiJHu5HoPPEDvhN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Labeling functions for agent progress probe.\n2\t\n3\tEach LF takes a sliding window of steps and returns:\n4\t  1 = progress, 0 = stagnation, -1 = abstain\n5\t\"\"\"\n6\t\n7\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n8\t\n9\timport re\n10\tfrom difflib import SequenceMatcher\n11\tfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n12\t\n13\tif TYPE_CHECKING:\n14\t    from data_loader import Step, Trajectory\n15\t\n16\tPROGRESS = 1\n17\tSTAGNATION = 0\n18\tABSTAIN = -1\n19\t\n20\tEDIT_PATTERN = re.compile(r\"^edit\\s+\\d+\", re.MULTILINE)\n21\tSEARCH_CMDS = {\"search_dir\", \"search_file\", \"find_file\", \"find\", \"grep\"}\n22\t\n23\t\n24\tdef _extract_edited_files(steps: list[Step]) -> tuple[int, set[str]]:\n25\t    \"\"\"Count edit commands and unique files edited in a window.\"\"\"\n26\t    edit_count = 0\n27\t    files = set()\n28\t    for step in steps:\n29\t        if not step.is_action:\n30\t            continue\n31\t        cmd = step.command\n32\t        if not cmd:\n33\t            continue\n34\t        if cmd.strip().startswith(\"edit\"):\n35\t            edit_count += 1\n36\t            # Try to get the filename from the next observation\n37\t            idx = step.index\n38\t            for s in steps:\n39\t                if s.index == idx + 1 and s.is_observation:\n40\t                    match = re.search(r\"\\[File:\\s*([^\\]]+?)(?:\\s*\\(\\d+\\s*lines)\", s.text)\n41\t                    if match:\n42\t                        files.add(match.group(1).strip())\n43\t                    break\n44\t    return edit_count, files\n45\t\n46\t\n47\tdef _count_search_only(steps: list[Step]) -> int:\n48\t    \"\"\"Count consecutive search/find commands without any edit.\"\"\"\n49\t    count = 0\n50\t    for step in steps:\n51\t        if not step.is_action:\n52\t            continue\n53\t        cmd = step.command\n54\t        if not cmd:\n55\t            continue\n56\t        first_word = cmd.strip().split()[0] if cmd.strip() else \"\"\n57\t        if first_word in SEARCH_CMDS:\n58\t            count += 1\n59\t    return count\n60\t\n61\t\n62\tdef lf_file_diff_delta(window: list[Step], trajectory: Trajectory, window_position: dict) -> int:\n63\t    \"\"\"LF1: Whether the agent is meaningfully modifying code in this window.\"\"\"\n64\t    edit_count, files = _extract_edited_files(window)\n65\t\n66\t    if edit_count >= 2 and len(files) >= 1:\n67\t        return PROGRESS\n68\t    if edit_count == 0:\n69\t        search_count = _count_search_only(window)\n70\t        if search_count >= 3:\n71\t            return STAGNATION\n72\t        return ABSTAIN\n73\t    return ABSTAIN\n74\t\n75\t\n76\tdef _cmd_similarity(a: str, b: str) -> float:\n77\t    \"\"\"Character-level similarity between two commands using SequenceMatcher.\"\"\"\n78\t    if a == b:\n79\t        return 1.0\n80\t    if not a or not b:\n81\t        return 0.0\n82\t    return SequenceMatcher(None, a, b).ratio()\n83\t\n84\t\n85\tdef _has_consecutive_similar(commands: list[str], min_run: int = 3, threshold: float = 0.9) -> bool:\n86\t    \"\"\"Check if there are ≥min_run consecutive commands with similarity > threshold.\"\"\"\n87\t    if len(commands) < min_run:\n88\t        return False\n89\t    run = 1\n90\t    for i in range(1, len(commands)):\n91\t        if _cmd_similarity(commands[i - 1], commands[i]) >= threshold:\n92\t            run += 1\n93\t            if run >= min_run:\n94\t                return True\n95\t        else:\n96\t            run = 1\n97\t    return False\n98\t\n99\t\n100\tdef lf_command_repetition(window: list[Step], trajectory: Trajectory, window_position: dict) -> int:\n101\t    \"\"\"LF2: Detect command repetition patterns as stagnation signal.\"\"\"\n102\t    commands = [s.command for s in window if s.is_action and s.command is not None]\n103\t\n104\t    if len(commands) < 2:\n105\t        return ABSTAIN\n106\t\n107\t    if _has_consecutive_similar(commands, min_run=3, threshold=1.0):\n108\t        return STAGNATION\n109\t\n110\t    if _has_consecutive_similar(commands, min_run=3, threshold=0.9):\n111\t        return STAGNATION\n112\t\n113\t    if len(set(commands)) == len(commands):\n114\t        return PROGRESS\n115\t\n116\t    return ABSTAIN\n117\t\n118\t\n119\t# --- Deprecated ---\n120\tdef _parse_test_pass_rate(text: str) -> float | None:\n121\t    passed = 0\n122\t    failed = 0\n123\t    passed_lines = re.findall(r\"PASSED\\s+\\S+\", text)\n124\t    failed_lines = re.findall(r\"FAILED\\s+\\S+\", text)\n125\t    passed += len(passed_lines)\n126\t    failed += len(failed_lines)\n127\t    summary_passed = re.search(r\"(\\d+)\\s+passed\", text)\n128\t    summary_failed = re.search(r\"(\\d+)\\s+failed\", text)\n129\t    if summary_passed and passed == 0:\n130\t        passed = int(summary_passed.group(1))\n131\t    if summary_failed and failed == 0:\n132\t        failed = int(summary_failed.group(1))\n133\t    total = passed + failed\n134\t    if total == 0:\n135\t        return None\n136\t    return passed / total\n137\t\n138\t\n139\tdef lf_test_pass_rate_transition_deprecated(window: list[Step], trajectory: Trajectory, window_position: dict) -> int:\n140\t    \"\"\"LF2 (deprecated): Whether test pass rate is improving within the window.\"\"\"\n141\t    test_runs = []\n142\t    for step in window:\n143\t        if not step.is_observation:\n144\t            continue\n145\t        if not step.has_test_output:\n146\t            continue\n147\t        rate = _parse_test_pass_rate(step.text)\n148\t        if rate is not None:\n149\t            test_runs.append(rate)\n150\t    if len(test_runs) < 2:\n151\t        return ABSTAIN\n152\t    last = test_runs[-1]\n153\t    second_last = test_runs[-2]\n154\t    if last > second_last:\n155\t        return PROGRESS\n156\t    return STAGNATION\n157\t\n158\t\n159\tdef lf_outcome_backpropagation(window: list[Step], trajectory: Trajectory, window_position: dict) -> int:\n160\t    \"\"\"LF3: Label last windows based on final trajectory outcome.\"\"\"\n161\t    total_windows = window_position[\"total_windows\"]\n162\t    window_idx = window_position[\"window_idx\"]\n163\t\n164\t    is_last_two = window_idx >= total_windows - 2\n165\t\n166\t    if trajectory.exit_status in (\"exit_context\",):\n167\t        return STAGNATION\n168\t\n169\t    if not is_last_two:\n170\t        return ABSTAIN\n171\t\n172\t    if trajectory.target:\n173\t        return PROGRESS\n174\t    else:\n175\t        return STAGNATION\n176\t\n177\t\n178\tALL_LFS = [\n179\t    (\"file_diff_delta\", lf_file_diff_delta),\n180\t    (\"command_repetition\", lf_command_repetition),\n181\t    (\"outcome_backpropagation\", lf_outcome_backpropagation),\n182\t]\n183\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JkEJZpUPNgEhfSMiVuwcMv","session_id":"3eaa2ba6-aa45-4be4-a541-eab7cb4981f6","uuid":"fc0c1b1c-1629-47b0-b363-3b9905bf2798","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:59:34.882Z"}
